# PestPac by WorkWave

Last updated: 2026-09-22

> PestPac by WorkWave is pest control business management software built specifically for pest control companies, from single-location owner-operators to national enterprises managing multiple branches. With more than 40 years of pest industry experience behind it, PestPac combines scheduling, route optimization, CRM, billing and payments, termite and WDO inspection reporting, chemical and material tracking, regulatory forms and compliance documentation, multi-unit and commercial account management, marketing automation, reporting, and a mobile app for field technicians. PestPac is a brand of WorkWave, a vertical B2B software company founded in 1984 and headquartered in Holmdel, New Jersey.

