- Customer portal: Self-service portal where customers can view accounts, service history, and invoices and make payments.
- Customer communication: Automated service reminders, notifications, and customer messaging.
- Marketing software solutions: Marketing automation, lead generation, online reviews, and customer surveys.
- Website builder: Pest control website creation and hosting.
- Reporting: Operational, productivity, and revenue reporting for pest control businesses.
- Accounting integration: Integration with accounting systems including QuickBooks.
- Fintech and payments: Integrated payment processing and financial tools through WorkWave Fintech.
- API and integrations: API access and third-party integrations for pest control operations.

